WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.677
This is the one place the code deliberately
overrides the program's own setting,

2
00:00:04.677 --> 00:00:06.850
and it ties straight back to Chapter 2.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.525
The emergency accounts hold
Global Administrator permanently.

4
00:00:10.525 --> 00:00:15.651
A monthly review of that role, set to remove
access on silence with auto-apply on,

5
00:00:15.651 --> 00:00:19.437
would quietly remove them the
first month reviewers miss.

6
00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:23.425
Learn itself warns that the
combination can revoke all access.

7
00:00:23.425 --> 00:00:26.370
So that one series makes
no change on silence,

8
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.987
and anything left unreviewed turns
into an evidence finding instead.

9
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:35.380
Every other series still removes
access when reviewers stay silent.
